  "question": {
    "text": "A tower subtends an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> at a point on the same level as the foot of the tower and at another point, <math><mn>10</mn></math> meters above the first, the angle of depression of the foot of the tower is <math><msup><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> The height of the tower is (in meters)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
